Subject: [PATCH 5/6] catch error from epoll_unregister

Summary:
# Motivation:
call to epoll_unregister is causing device to be unreachable
# Overview:
- remove unwrap

Test Plan:
# Build host tools
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
```
make symlink to replace tools in gw-cf-emu
# Launch
```
HOME=/Users/achong/gw-cf-emu/host/darwin-arm64 ./host/darwin-arm64/bin/launch_cvd --use-overlay=false --vm_manager=qemu_cli --qemu_binary_dir=$(pwd)/qemu-cf/darwin-aarch64/bin/ --enable-audio=false --enable_host_uwb=false -console=true --start_webrtc=false --vhost_user_vsock -device_external_network=slirp --system_image_dir=$(pwd) -guest_enforce_security=false -noset_fstab_suffix &> ~/logs.tx
```

